1
00:02:00,530 --> 00:02:03,530
Where's Mom?

2
00:02:03,530 --> 00:02:05,530
She went to a school-board meeting.

3
00:02:05,530 --> 00:02:08,530
I don't know how she does it.

4
00:02:08,530 --> 00:02:09,530
She sure keeps busy.

5
00:02:09,530 --> 00:02:11,530
It's important to her.

6
00:02:11,530 --> 00:02:14,530
There are lots of places to go,

7
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:15,530
lots of things to do.

8
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:19,530
She can't sit around and do nothing.

9
00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:20,530
Philip works late. Philip

10
00:02:20,530 --> 00:02:22,530
I guess you're right.

11
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:25,530
I wish I had her energy.

12
00:02:25,530 --> 00:02:27,530
Anybody home?

13
00:02:27,530 --> 00:02:29,530
We're in here, Dad.

14
00:02:29,530 --> 00:02:33,530
Oh. Hi, gang.

15
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:34,530
Hello, Philip.

16
00:02:34,530 --> 00:02:35,530
How was your day?

17
00:02:35,530 --> 00:02:37,530
My day was just fine.

18
00:02:37,530 --> 00:02:39,530
So was my night.

19
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,530
It's almost ten o'clock.

20
00:02:41,530 --> 00:02:44,530
Mmm. I'm starving.

21
00:02:44,530 --> 00:02:45,530
Um ... where's Mom?

22
00:02:45,530 --> 00:02:47,530
She went to a school-board meeting.

23
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:50,530
There's a note for you on the refrigerator.

24
00:02:50,530 --> 00:03:27,530
Oh?

25
00:03:27,530 --> 00:03:30,530
Did you have dinner, Robbie?

26
00:03:30,530 --> 00:03:31,530
Yeah.

27
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:32,530
Mike and I had a hamburger at the diner. Mike

28
00:03:32,530 --> 00:03:33,530
I came home a little while ago.

29
00:03:33,530 --> 00:03:35,530
You've been working late

30
00:03:35,530 --> 00:03:37,530
almost every night this week, Dad.

31
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:38,530
Aren't you exhausted?

32
00:03:38,530 --> 00:03:41,530
I don't have time to be exhausted.

33
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:44,530
You and Mom haven't had dinner together with us

34
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:45,530
in almost a full week.

35
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:46,530
Yeah,

36
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:48,530
I feel bad

37
00:03:48,530 --> 00:03:50,530
about us not having dinner with the family,

38
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:52,530
but our schedules are so different.

39
00:03:52,530 --> 00:03:54,530
Either I'm at the hospital doing paperwork,

40
00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:56,530
or Mom is at a committee meeting.

41
00:03:56,530 --> 00:03:59,530
I frankly don't know what to do about it.

42
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:02,530
I'm worried about you and Mom.

43
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:05,530
You really have been working too hard.

44
00:04:05,530 --> 00:04:06,530
Well,

45
00:04:06,530 --> 00:04:08,530
I think I've had enough of that sandwich.

46
00:04:08,530 --> 00:04:10,530
You didn't finish it.

47
00:04:10,530 --> 00:04:15,530
It's not good to eat before going to bed.

48
00:04:15,530 --> 00:04:19,530
A cookie can't hurt, though.

49
00:04:19,530 --> 00:04:21,530
Well,

50
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:23,530
I'm heading off for bed

51
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:24,530
and a good night's sleep.

52
00:04:24,530 --> 00:04:26,530
Well, good night.

53
00:04:26,530 --> 00:04:27,530
Good night, Son.

54
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:30,530
Good night, Dad.

55
00:04:30,530 --> 00:04:31,530
I'm going to bed.

56
00:04:31,530 --> 00:04:32,530
Good night, Philip.

57
00:04:32,530 --> 00:04:35,530
Haven't you finished balancing that checkbook?

58
00:04:35,530 --> 00:04:38,530
I found another mistake.

59
00:04:38,530 --> 00:04:41,530
I'll be off to bed myself in a minute.

60
00:04:41,530 --> 00:04:42,530
OK. Good night.

61
00:04:42,530 --> 00:04:53,530
I'm really concerned about them,

62
00:04:53,530 --> 00:04:54,530
Grandpa.

63
00:04:54,530 --> 00:04:55,530
Concerned about whom?

64
00:04:55,530 --> 00:04:57,530
About Mom and Dad.

65
00:04:57,530 --> 00:04:59,530
They hardly ever see each other.

66
00:04:59,530 --> 00:05:01,530
Dad often works late,

67
00:05:01,530 --> 00:05:03,530
and Mom has all these committees she's on.

68
00:05:03,530 --> 00:05:07,530
What do you propose to do about it?

69
00:05:07,530 --> 00:05:09,530
You have that look in your eye.

70
00:05:09,530 --> 00:05:10,530
I don't know,

71
00:05:10,530 --> 00:05:12,530
but there must be a way

72
00:05:12,530 --> 00:05:14,530
of getting them to spend more time together.

73
00:05:14,530 --> 00:05:17,530
Quality time.
